{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">HEX-ENCODE function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":939,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309791","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/HEX-ENCODE-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/HEX-ENCODE-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"HEX-ENCODE-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">HEX-ENCODE function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"HEX-ENCODE-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Converts a RAW value into a character string consisting\nof an even number of hexadecimal digits (0 through 9 and A through F).</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"HEX-ENCODE-function__syntax_GC18PB2694183\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d202499e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"HEX-ENCODE-function__idGDL2J72671365\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>HEX-ENCODE( <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A RAW expression containing the value you want to convert. If\nthe expression is the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>), the result is\nthe Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>). If the expression is a zero-length\nvalue, the result is a zero-length value.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\" id=\"HEX-ENCODE-function__note_N1008B_N1002F_N10021_N10001\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> The <code class=\"ph codeph\">BASE64-ENCODE</code>,\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">BASE64-DECODE</code>, <code class=\"ph codeph\">HEX-ENCODE</code>, and\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">HEX-DECODE</code> functions do not do any byte ordering. However, the binary\n        output of these functions may be a binary data type such as a MEMPTR or RAW. If the target\n        of these operation’s output is another system where the order of bytes (endianness) differs,\n        you must first normalize the data to what the receiving side is expecting. Otherwise, the\n        results may not be as expected. For example, for a MEMPTR value that you are building\n        yourself, you can use the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement.html\">SET-BYTE-ORDER statement</a> to set the byte order for the\n        MEMPTR variable before you read or write the value.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"HEX-ENCODE-function__example_GC18PC2694192\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d202499e165\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">The following code fragment illustrates how to use the\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">HEX-ENCODE</code> function:</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"HEX-ENCODE-function__idGDL2J82671371\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE MyUUID AS RAW       NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE vChar  AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.\n\nASSIGN\n  MyUUID = GENERATE-UUID\n  vChar  = HEX-ENCODE(MyUUID).</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"HEX-ENCODE-function__see-also_GC18PD2694196\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d202499e197\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"HEX-DECODE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/HEX-DECODE-function.html\">HEX-DECODE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement.html\">SET-BYTE-ORDER statement</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"HEX-DECODE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/HEX-DECODE-function.html\">HEX-DECODE function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"HIDE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/HIDE-statement.html\">HIDE statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309791","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":938,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"HEX-ENCODE function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/HEX-ENCODE-function.html","type":"Manual"}